{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your job: Keep an ungrateful monarch alive. Your tools: 8 expendable guards, gallows humor and questionable moral standards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905770/extras/472c114c6d7b38ffeeef482b2f2bde45.poster.avif?t=1753723782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905770/extras/472c114c6d7b38ffeeef482b2f2bde45.webm?t=1753723782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command your warriors through a downward spiral of danger and misfortune, strategically <span class=\"bb_strike\">escorting</span> shoving the king through a maze of traps, assassins, angry peasants and the occasional donkey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905770/extras/7d296a61de8f5c7c8d453ead8ab781b2.poster.avif?t=1753723782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905770/extras/7d296a61de8f5c7c8d453ead8ab781b2.webm?t=1753723782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Position your warriors as human shields. Use them to trigger traps. Talk them out of healthcare. Dig into their retirement funds. Spend money on gear and upgrades for your soldiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905770/extras/4529d9f8b4b0e4ed5946cd63403f0448.poster.avif?t=1753723782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905770/extras/4529d9f8b4b0e4ed5946cd63403f0448.webm?t=1753723782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn your units into trap detection specialists or crazed butchers. Identify traitors in your ranks. Bit by bit, uncover their personal stories and clues about what happened to each of the kingdoms you visit.  <br>  <br>Like chess, without the dice.  <br>  <br> <br>DEMO FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Unique Worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ Lines of Dialog</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Achievements </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric Audio Design </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handcrafted Pixelart </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905770?t=1753723782","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905770/f15177b1239ec2eb5bdfa10c739821533d63374a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753723782","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905770/c8e5ba5ee658db3ca10779ae3dc0149834130f5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753723782","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905770/c8e5ba5ee658db3ca10779ae3dc0149834130f5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753723782","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoon violence in character fights and cutscenes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your job: Keep an ungrateful monarch alive. Your tools: 8 expendable guards, gallows humor and questionable moral standards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vid